  'draft', 'core',
  'A 63-year-old man with a mechanical mitral valve replacement presents with fever and new-onset AV block on ECG. Blood cultures grow coagulase-negative staphylococcus in multiple bottles. Transoesophageal echocardiogram confirms a vegetation extending into the mitral annulus with evidence of a periannular abscess.',
